{"meta":{"ui":"reservation","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"generate","prompt":"Let me book a table at Osteria Lume as an inline card: pick one of the next seven days (Sat 14, Sun 15, Mon 16, Tue 17, Wed 18, Thu 19, Fri 20), a party size from 1 to 8 (starting at 2), then a time slot: 17:30, 18:00, 18:30, 19:00, 19:30, 20:00, 20:30 or 21:00. Some are full and cannot be picked: on Sat 14 the 18:00 and 20:00 slots; on Sun 15 the 17:30 and 19:00 slots; on every day, for parties of 5 or more, 20:30 and 21:00 too. A confirm button, and once I confirm the card says \"Table booked\" with one line giving the day, the party size and the time.","text":"The party size rule (5 or more cannot take 20:30 or 21:00) depends on party, so the disabled list must be computed from it. I'll use a let for the disabled slots and a Counter for party size. The day and time pickers keep their chosen text in variables, and confirm sets a done flag that swaps the card to the receipt.\n\nstate day=\"Sat 14\"\nstate party=2\nstate time=\"\"\nstate done=false\nlet full = party >= 5 ? [\"20:30\",\"21:00\"] : []\nlet dayFull = day == \"Sat 14\" ? [\"18:00\",\"20:00\"] : (day == \"Sun 15\" ? [\"17:30\",\"19:00\"] : [])\nlet blocked = join(unique(append(dayFull, full)), \",\")\nlet when = day + \", \" + party + \" guests at \" + time\nif done == false\n  ChatCard \"Osteria Lume\" \"Book a table\" icon:\"restaurant\" status:\"Open\" w:390\n    SectionLabel \"Day\" \"next 7 days\"\n    DayPicker =day days:[\"Sat 14\",\"Sun 15\",\"Mon 16\",\"Tue 17\",\"Wed 18\",\"Thu 19\",\"Fri 20\"] -> time=\"\"\n    SectionLabel \"Party size\" \"1 to 8\"\n    Counter \"Guests\" =party min:1 max:8 step:1 -> time=\"\"\n    SectionLabel \"Time\" \"pick a slot\"\n    ChoiceChips =time options:[\"17:30\",\"18:00\",\"18:30\",\"19:00\",\"19:30\",\"20:00\",\"20:30\",\"21:00\"] disabled:[dayFull, full] columns:4\n    ActionButton \"Confirm booking\" primary enabled:{time != \"\"} -> done=true\nif done == true\n  Receipt \"Table booked\" \"{when}\" tone:good icon:\"check\" w:390","usage":{"input_tokens":9528,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":578,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard","output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0}},"ttftMs":1030,"totalMs":3415}}
